WEBVTT

00:04:58.796 --> 00:05:01.636
That does not make Russia a global pariah

00:05:01.636 --> 00:05:03.716
because you can't be a global pariah

00:05:03.756 --> 00:05:06.916
if the soon-to-be most important
economy in the world, China,

00:05:06.956 --> 00:05:09.276
is actually your bestie
on the global stage,

00:05:09.276 --> 00:05:11.596
and that indeed continues to be true

00:05:11.636 --> 00:05:14.076
despite China's efforts
to portray themselves,

00:05:14.116 --> 00:05:15.476
towards Europe at least,

00:05:15.516 --> 00:05:17.636
as more neutral.

00:05:17.676 --> 00:05:22.396
We are going to see the Russians
as a supplicant economically,

00:05:22.436 --> 00:05:23.876
in terms of energy flows,

00:05:23.916 --> 00:05:25.796
financially, in terms of transactions,

00:05:25.836 --> 00:05:28.436
and technologically,
perhaps most important,

00:05:28.436 --> 00:05:30.396
aligned with China.